Traffic per month (MB)
Unlimited

Traffic is what the websites send to their visitors in a calendar month (server time). When it is used up, only the websites show “traffic limit reached” until the 1st; mail, databases and file access keep working. It is counted every 5 minutes, so a site can go over its limit by what it sends in that time.

